<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/assessment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A systematic examination of a system, process, or outcome to evaluate compliance of specific work products with a specific expectation with a specification, regulation or standard. Often involves judgement and a rationale of this judgement."@en .
