<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/EvidenceType/observation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Documentation of direct monitoring or witnessing of the demonstration of processes, tests, or any kind of system responses during a specified timeframe under specified environmental conditions."@en .
